-- STILL OPEN, and unchanged in kind: the literal momentum-space joint
-- Wilson + reduced Faddeev-Popov + Haar density of the CMP109
-- background-field vacuum polarisation, together with a bound on the
-- negative part of its (4,6,4,1)-weighted combination below the threshold of
